# Whitelist: only what is needed to run the experiments and check the reported results is tracked.
# Not tracked on purpose: publisher PDFs (copyright), the thesis, slides, the manuscript and its
# submission files and notes, the original-code backup, and superseded run outputs and logs.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/DES_phyNnurse.py
!/Code/
/Code/_backup_original_*/
!/Data/
!/Phase1_rerun/
/Phase1_rerun/DATA_CHECK.md
# Run outputs: the results reported in the paper are tracked. Superseded imports, the old model's
# results, smoke tests and logs (which contain local machine paths) are not.
/Phase1_rerun/results/_before_*/
/Phase1_rerun/results/legacy_model/
/Phase1_rerun/results/logs/
/Phase1_rerun/results/data_check.txt
/Phase1_rerun/results/**/smoke/
!/Phase2/
/Phase2/results/_archive_*/
!/tools/
!/Manuscript/
/Manuscript/*
!/Manuscript/figures/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
results_bundle_*.zip
machine_info_*.txt
.venv/
